"t09" [shape=box style=rounded label="9. Agent banks and gateways to Payment\nApplication Secure: Abstract of collection,\nencrypted and authenticated" tooltip="10b-09"]
"t10" [shape=box style=rounded label="10. Payment Application Secure to E2M customs\nsystem: Confirmed payment" tooltip="10b-10"]
"t11" [shape=box style=rounded label="11. E2M customs system to Taxpayers and\nimporters: Release of the goods" tooltip="10b-11"]
"t12" [shape=box style=rounded label="12. Agent banks and gateways to Treasury\nSingle Account: Remit collections to the\naccount of the Treasury, daily" tooltip="10b-12"]
"t13" [shape=box style=rounded label="13. Agent banks and gateways to eTRAMS: Report\nof collections to BTr" tooltip="10b-13"]
"t14" [shape=box style=rounded label="14. eTRAMS: Monitor collections and\ndisbursements (eTRAMS)" tooltip="10b-14"]
"t15" [shape=box style=rounded label="15. eTRAMS to eFPS and eBIRForms: Compare\nremittances with collection reports" tooltip="10b-15"]
"t16" [shape=box style=rounded label="16. eTRAMS to E2M customs system: Compare\nremittances with collection reports" tooltip="10b-16"]
